<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-NO PLAY BEFORE LUNCH IN JOHANNESBURG TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NO PLAY BEFORE LUNCH IN JOHANNESBURG TEST.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight rain prevented any play before lunch on the second day of the third and final test match between South Africa and India at the Wanderers on Friday.</p>
<p>Play would commence at 1310 local time (1110 GMT),  weather permitting, officials said. India are 233 for three in their first innings.</p>
